<statement>
<p>Write the augmented matrix of the system and use it to solve the system. If the system has an infinite number of solutions, express them in terms of the parameter <m>\displaystyle{x}_{{4}}</m> . If there is no solution to the system, type "DNE" for each variable.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}_{{1}}-{2}{x}_{{2}}-{x}_{{3}}+{3}{x}_{{4}}={0}</m> </p>
<p><m>\displaystyle-{2}{x}_{{1}}+{4}{x}_{{2}}+{5}{x}_{{3}}-{5}{x}_{{4}}={3}</m></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{3}{x}_{{1}}-{6}{x}_{{2}}-{6}{x}_{{3}}+{8}{x}_{{4}}={2}</m></p>
<p>  </p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}_{{1}}</m>  = <fillin characters="20"/></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}_{{2}}</m>  = <fillin characters="20"/></p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{x}_{{3}}</m>  = <fillin characters="20"/></p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{x}_{{4}}</m>  = <fillin characters="20"/></p>

</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>DNE</li><li>DNE</li><li>DNE</li><li>DNE</li></ul></p>
</answer>

